@startuml SEQ_22_MELIHAT_TUGAS_PRAKTIKUM
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-22: Melihat Tugas Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as User
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "TugasPraktikumController"         as Controller
entity      "TugasPraktikum Model"             as Model
database    "tugas_praktikum"                  as DB

== Lihat Daftar Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Tugas" di halaman praktikum
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/tugas
Controller -> Model    : Query tugas berdasarkan praktikum
Model -> DB            : SELECT tugas_praktikum WHERE praktikum_id = ?
DB --> Model           : Data tugas
Model --> Controller   : Data tugas
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar tugas
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan daftar tugas\n(view-only)

== Lihat Detail Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik nama tugas
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}
Controller -> Model    : Query detail tugas
Model -> DB            : SELECT tugas_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Data tugas
Model --> Controller   : Data tugas
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman detail tugas
Browser    --> User    : Detail tugas: judul, deskripsi, deadline, file lampiran (jika ada)

== Download / View File Tugas ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik tombol "Download" pada tugas
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/download
Controller -> Model    : Query tugas
Model -> DB            : SELECT tugas_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Data tugas
Model --> Controller   : Data tugas
Controller --> Browser : Download file
Browser    --> User    : File diunduh

@enduml
